quickshell (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * d/watch, d/upstream/signing-key.asc: Verify signed upstream tag.
  * d/control: Restrict architecture to linux-any.
  * d/control: Add libcpptrace-dev, libvulkan-dev, libpolkit-agent-1-dev,
    libpolkit-gobject-1-dev, and libglib2.0-dev to Build-Depends.
  * d/rules: Disable PCH to work around non-deterministic DWARF
    (see GCC bug 124811, Debian #1131840).
  * d/rules: Drop CRASH_REPORTER and DISTRIBUTOR_DEBUGINFO_AVAILABLE,
    which were removed upstream after cpptrace replaced breakpad.
  * d/control: Bump Standards-Version to 4.7.4 (no changes needed).
  * d/control: Drop redundant Priority: optional from source paragraph.
  * d/copyright: Extend outfoxxed copyright range to 2026.
  * d/quickshell.1: Update for 0.3.0.

 -- Michael Lloyd <michael@micl.dev>  Wed, 06 May 2026 16:28:12 +1000

